SUMMARY:Story in the Scent
DESCRIPTION:In this display\, we invite you to discover the various fragrances inspired by the cities of the Kingdom&mdash\;from incense to flowers&mdash\;and uncover the magic of each fragrance and its unique ways of blending. As fragrance has always been an integral part of our Eid rituals\, participants will embark on a sensory experience to relate each scent to a story and to cherish memories.
